41474::$$$message_0302_0000_0000$$$::"Now here's a rare ema. [wm canskip=0][cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01d(中)][wvl][clfg storage=120_寸劇歓声02 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01d(中)][move textoff=0 time=150 path=(454,59,255)(454,44,255) storage=凛巫女服01d(中) accel=-2]Let's move on to the next one."[wm canskip=0]::
41475::$$$message_0302_0001_0000$$$::"Oh?[wvl canskip=0 time=400] Are you going to let such injustice against yourself go unpunished?"::
41476::$$$message_0302_0002_0000$$$::"...!"::
41477::$$$message_0302_0003_0000$$$::"I'll give a simple explanation. Her name is Rin Tohsaka. On the (Left) is a new 'Rin Surprised by a Bidet.' The internal codename is also 'Rin Surprised by a Bidet.' If you need help remembering it, you can call it 'TOHSAKA on the Bidet.'"::
41478::$$$message_0302_0004_0000$$$::"Move on to the swimsuit!"::
41479::$$$message_0302_0005_0000$$$::"All right. This is a swimsuit. [cacheimage storage=アーチャー神主01c(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=アーチャー神主01c(中)]It's red."::
41480::$$$message_0302_0006_0000$$$::"RrrrgghI'llkillyouI'llkillyou."��Uk